it_fancy_vocab_035	To filter	de:D Filtern is a transparent, high-frequency verb, and no specific technical, editorial or information-leak sense is selected. || es:D Filtrar is a transparent high-frequency verb, and no specific technical, editorial or leak sense is selected. || fr:D Filtrer is a transparent, high-frequency verb, and no specific technical, editorial or information-leak sense is selected. || it:D Filtrare is a transparent, high-frequency verb, and no specific technical, editorial or information-leak sense is selected. || pt:D Filtrar é um verbo transparente e frequente, sem sentido técnico, editorial ou de vazamento selecionado no item.
it_fancy_vocab_036	To access	de:K English uses a transitive verb, while German requires the separable frame auf etwas zugreifen, omitted by old_back. || es:K English uses a transitive verb, whereas Spanish requires the governed frame acceder a, omitted by old_back. || fr:K English uses a transitive verb, whereas French requires accéder à, with contraction before plural articles. || it:K English uses a transitive verb, whereas Italian requires the governed frame accedere a, omitted by old_back. || pt:K O português brasileiro usa acessar transitivamente, em contraste com outras línguas e com aceder a; old_back contém para indevido.
it_fancy_vocab_037	To manipulate	de:D Manipulieren is a transparent cognate with the same critical sense and no distinct government or morphology issue here. || es:D Transparent cognate with the same critical sense and no distinct government or morphology issue here. || fr:D Manipuler is a transparent cognate with the same critical sense and no distinct government or morphology issue here. || it:D Manipolare is a transparent cognate with the same critical sense and no distinct government or morphology issue here. || pt:D Manipular é um cognato transparente com o mesmo sentido crítico, sem regência ou morfologia distintiva no original.
it_fancy_vocab_038	To diversify	de:D Diversifizieren is a transparent policy and finance cognate; the prompt does not choose a reflexive or portfolio-specific frame. || es:D Transparent policy cognate with ordinary morphology and no specialized sense selected by the prompt. || fr:D Diversifier is a transparent policy and finance cognate, and the prompt does not choose a transitive or pronominal frame. || it:D Diversificare is a transparent policy and finance cognate, and the prompt does not choose a transitive or pronominal frame. || pt:D Diversificar é um cognato frequente em políticas e finanças, e o item não seleciona uma construção transitiva ou pronominal.
it_fancy_vocab_039	To centralize	de:D Zentralisieren is a transparent institutional cognate already owned at C1 and accurately represented by the legacy gloss. || es:D Transparent institutional cognate already owned at C1 and accurately represented by the legacy gloss. || fr:D Centraliser is a transparent institutional cognate already owned at C1 and accurately represented by the legacy gloss. || it:D Centralizzare is a transparent institutional cognate already owned at C1 and accurately represented by the legacy gloss. || pt:D Centralizar é um cognato institucional transparente, corretamente representado por old_back e já esperado no nível C1.
it_fancy_vocab_040	To outsource	de:K Auslagern is separable and takes an plus the accusative for the provider; it also contrasts usefully with externalisieren and outsourcen. || es:K European Spanish distinguishes externalizar from contract-focused subcontratar and regional tercerizar. || fr:K Externaliser contrasts usefully with contractor-specific sous-traiter and the corporate Anglicism outsourcer. || it:K Esternalizzare contrasts usefully with geographic delocalizzare and contract-specific appaltare. || pt:K Terceirizar é a opção brasileira produtiva, contrasta com subcontratar e externalizar, e old_back contém um para indevido.

## b02
it_fancy_vocab_041	To curate	de:K Kuratieren has a marked domain register and denotes deliberate selection plus contextual presentation, not merely general care or supervision. || es:K  || fr:K The media-specific sense requires selection plus contextual presentation; legacy conserver means preservation instead. || it:K Editorial curare denotes deliberate selection, organization and contextual presentation, a marked sense that differs from mere preservation or general care. || pt:K Fazer a curadoria de evita o calque curar conteúdo e ensina uma construção produtiva de mídia e pesquisa.
it_fancy_vocab_042	To monetize	de:D Monetarisieren is a transparent and frequent digital-economy cognate with ordinary transitive syntax and an accurate legacy gloss. || es:D Transparent technology cognate with no distinct government, false-friend or nonliteral sense selected by the isolated prompt. || fr:D Monétiser is a transparent, frequent digital-economy cognate with ordinary transitive syntax and an accurate legacy gloss. || it:D Monetizzare is a transparent, frequent digital-economy cognate with ordinary transitive syntax and no distinct production issue in the isolated prompt. || pt:D Monetizar é um cognato transparente e corrente no discurso de plataformas, sem regência ou sentido adicional selecionado pelo item.
it_fancy_vocab_043	To embed	de:K Einbetten teaches separable morphology and the productive in-plus-accusative frame for the containing system or context. || es:K  || fr:K Embedded media is naturally intégrer quelque chose à quelque chose, a productive frame not supplied by the isolated legacy verb. || it:K Incorporare in supplies a productive element-and-container frame and avoids relying on the marked technical borrowing embeddare. || pt:K Incorporar ou integrar um componente é preferível ao jargão embedar, e old_back ainda contém um para indevido.
it_fancy_vocab_044	To interface	de:K German normally uses mit etwas interagieren for continuing system interaction; the legacy verbinden instead foregrounds establishing a connection. || es:K  || fr:K General technical prose distinguishes ongoing interaction with a system from the narrower engineering verb interfacer. || it:K System interaction normally uses the pronominal frame interfacciarsi con, while the legacy transitive form describes connecting components. || pt:K Interagir com oferece uma construção idiomática onde old_back reproduz o inglês com o decalque fazer interface.
it_fancy_vocab_045	To converge	de:D Konvergieren is a transparent academic and technical cognate, and the bare prompt selects no distinct mathematical, technical or figurative frame. || es:K  || fr:K The useful choice between converger vers an outcome and converger sur a finding gives the cognate genuine production value. || it:K The choice between convergere su a shared position and convergere verso an outcome gives the transparent cognate real production value. || pt:D Convergir é um cognato formal transparente, corretamente representado por old_back e sem complemento específico no original.
it_fancy_vocab_046	To leverage	de:K The legacy Hebelwirkung is a noun, while the English verb requires an idiomatic verbal rendering such as etwas gezielt nutzen. || es:K  || fr:K The idiomatic verbal frame tirer parti de avoids managerial calques and restores the governed preposition omitted by old_back. || it:K Fare leva su is an idiomatic governed expression that avoids both a literal use of levare and marked managerial calques. || pt:K Tirar partido de fixa o uso estratégico de um recurso e evita tratar o jargão alavancar como equivalente universal.
it_fancy_vocab_047	To customize	de:D Individuell anpassen is readily compositional, while the isolated prompt adds no distinct configuration or user-needs frame beyond familiar anpassen. || es:D Transparent and high-frequency cognate; the bare prompt supplies no distinct European-Spanish government or register lesson. || fr:D Personnaliser is a transparent, high-frequency equivalent with ordinary morphology and no selected specialized sense. || it:D Personalizzare is a transparent, high-frequency equivalent with ordinary morphology and no specialized complement or contrast selected here. || pt:D Personalizar é um equivalente direto, frequente e transparente, sem contraste produtivo adicional no item isolado.
it_fancy_vocab_048	To automate	de:D Automatisieren is a transparent, high-frequency technical cognate with ordinary morphology and no selected production trap. || es:D Transparent technical cognate with ordinary morphology and no additional C1 production issue in the isolated infinitive. || fr:D Automatiser is a transparent technical cognate with ordinary morphology and no additional C1 production issue here. || it:D Automatizzare is a transparent, high-frequency technical cognate with ordinary morphology and no additional C1 production lesson. || pt:D Automatizar é um cognato técnico transparente e de morfologia regular, já esperado no nível C1.
it_fancy_vocab_049	To digitize	de:D Digitalisieren is a transparent, high-frequency equivalent, and the prompt does not select a narrower document, process or signal sense. || es:D Transparent technical cognate accurately represented by digitalizar; the prompt does not select a special collocation or contrast. || fr:K Numériser usefully contrasts analog-to-digital conversion with broader organizational digitaliser and narrower scanner. || it:D Digitalizzare is a transparent, frequent technical equivalent, and the bare prompt does not select a document, signal or organizational-process contrast. || pt:D Digitalizar é um equivalente corrente e transparente; o original não seleciona a conversão de documentos, processos ou serviços para criar uma distinção.
it_fancy_vocab_050	To enforce	de:K German distinguishes laws or duties durchsetzen from outcomes erzwingen and judgments or penalties vollstrecken; old_back overgeneralizes one sense. || es:K  || fr:K French distinguishes making actors comply with faire respecter from merely establishing or applying a rule. || it:K Italian distinguishes making actors comply with far rispettare from merely applying, implementing or executing a rule. || pt:K Fazer cumprir distingue a execução de uma norma vigente da imposição ou criação de novas regras.
it_fancy_vocab_051	To restrict	de:D Einschränken is a familiar general verb already owned before C1, and the source provides no complement that would motivate beschränken auf. || es:K  || fr:D Restreindre is a transparent, familiar formal verb, and the bare prompt selects no distinct complement or specialized sense. || it:D Limitare is a familiar general verb already owned before C1, and the prompt supplies no complement that would select a narrower construction. || pt:D Restringir é um cognato frequente, transparente e corretamente identificado por old_back, sem regência distintiva no item.
it_fancy_vocab_052	To profile	de:K In the digital-data sense German normally says ein Profil von jemandem erstellen; profilieren has different standard meanings. || es:K  || fr:K Old_back has the wrong part of speech, while data profiling calls for the explicit verbal frame établir le profil de quelqu’un. || it:K Digital-data profilare is a marked transitive sense that contrasts usefully with the unrelated pronominal verb profilarsi. || pt:K Traçar o perfil de ensina a construção analítica e evita a leitura de criar perfis como simples abertura de contas.
it_fancy_vocab_053	To aggregate	de:D Aggregieren is a transparent technical cognate, and the isolated prompt does not select a data, statistical or organizational sense requiring a less obvious rendering. || es:K  || fr:D Agréger is a transparent, standard technical cognate, and no statistical or organizational contrast is selected by the prompt. || it:D Aggregare is a transparent technical cognate, and the isolated prompt does not select a statistical, data-processing or organizational sense. || pt:K A distinção técnica entre agregar registros e coletá-los tem valor produtivo em análise e governança de dados.
it_fancy_vocab_054	To obfuscate	de:K Analytical obfuscation is verschleiern or unkenntlich machen, whereas the legacy verdunkeln normally describes literal darkening. || es:K  || fr:K Analytical prose favors rendre opaque or obscurcir, while obfusquer is specialist computing usage and offusquer is a false friend. || it:K General analytical prose often needs rendere opaco, while offuscare has narrower common collocations and a specialist code-obfuscation use. || pt:K Ofuscar tem um sentido técnico especializado para código, distinto de seus sentidos gerais de deslumbrar ou eclipsar.
it_fancy_vocab_055	To perpetuate	de:K Social and institutional patterns are idiomatically fortgeschrieben or aufrechterhalten; verewigen is overly literal and exaggerated. || es:K  || fr:K Perpétuer has valuable critical collocations and must be distinguished from false friend perpétrer. || it:K Perpetuare has valuable critical collocations and must be distinguished from perpetrare, which means committing a serious harmful act. || pt:D Perpetuar é um cognato acadêmico transparente, frequente em crítica social e sem armadilha própria no original isolado.
it_fancy_vocab_056	To navigate	de:K For managing complex rules or institutions, German prefers the reflexive frame sich in etwas zurechtfinden over a bare calqued navigieren. || es:K  || fr:K Navigating a complex institution is idiomatically s’orienter dans, unlike literal or interface-oriented naviguer. || it:K Managing complex rules or institutions is naturally orientarsi tra, rather than relying on the more literal or digital default navigare. || pt:K No sentido figurado, lidar com uma crise ou impasse costuma ser mais idiomático que o decalque metafórico navegar.
it_fancy_vocab_057	To consolidate	de:K German usually renders consolidating power or a position with festigen, while konsolidieren is strongest in financial and organizational senses. || es:D Transparent cognate with ordinary morphology; the isolated prompt gives no specialized financial, institutional or discourse sense to preserve. || fr:D Consolider is a transparent, high-frequency cognate, and the source selects no distinct financial or institutional frame. || it:D Consolidare is a transparent, high-frequency cognate, and the source selects no distinct financial, organizational or power-entrenchment frame. || pt:D Consolidar é um cognato institucional transparente e o item não escolhe entre poder, dados, contas ou resultados.
it_fancy_vocab_058	To mediate	de:D Vermitteln is a familiar high-frequency equivalent, and the isolated source does not choose among conflict mediation, causal mediation or media intermediation. || es:K  || fr:K Legacy médiatiser is a meaning-changing false friend; conflict mediation requires servir d’intermédiaire or mener une médiation. || it:K The institutional frame mediare tra parties teaches useful government and guards against French-induced confusion with mediatizzare. || pt:K Mediar recebe como objeto a disputa ou negociação, estrutura produtiva que o infinitivo isolado não demonstra.
it_fancy_vocab_059	To amplify	de:D Verstärken is a basic and unambiguous equivalent whose ordinary transitive use offers no distinct C1 production lesson here. || es:D Transparent cognate whose common media and technical uses add no distinct government or interference lesson here. || fr:D Amplifier is a transparent, frequent equivalent, and the isolated prompt adds no distinct media or technical construction. || it:D Amplificare is a transparent, frequent equivalent, and the bare prompt supplies no specialized media, signal or rhetorical construction. || pt:D Amplificar é um cognato transparente e corrente tanto no sentido técnico quanto no figurado, sem complemento que fixe uma lição distinta.
it_fancy_vocab_060	To diminish	de:D Verringern is a familiar general equivalent, and the bare prompt does not select a transitive, intransitive or evaluative sense worth isolating. || es:D Transparent general verb; the isolated prompt does not choose a marked collocation or a sense distinct from disminuir. || fr:D Diminuer is a familiar general verb, and the prompt does not choose a transitive, intransitive or evaluative sense worth isolating. || it:D Diminuire is a familiar general verb, and the source does not select a transitive, intransitive or evaluative sense worth isolating. || pt:D Diminuir é um verbo básico de alta frequência e oferece pouco valor lexical próprio para um aluno C1.
it_fancy_vocab_061	To envision	de:D Sich etwas vorstellen is familiar and accurately supplied by old_back; the prompt contains no policy-planning nuance that would require ins Auge fassen. || es:K  || fr:D Envisager is a familiar accurate equivalent, while the bare prompt provides no narrower planning or visualization sense. || it:D Immaginare is a familiar, natural equivalent, while the isolated prompt does not select a planning, design or future-scenario sense requiring another verb. || pt:K Vislumbrar ou conceber fixa a projeção prospectiva que o literal visualizar de old_back nem sempre expressa.
it_fancy_vocab_062	To benchmark	de:K The legacy Benchmarking has the wrong part of speech, while German needs a verbal comparison frame with a reference value. || es:K  || fr:K Old_back is a noun, whereas the source needs a verbal comparison frame with an explicit reference point. || it:K Italian careful prose favors an explicit verbal comparison frame, while benchmark and benchmarking alone do not supply the source verb's syntax. || pt:K Usar como referência explicita a relação comparativa e evita depender do anglicismo empresarial fazer benchmarking.
it_fancy_vocab_063	To bypass	de:K Circumventing umgehen has valuable strong, inseparable morphology and contrasts with separable mit etwas umgehen meaning handle something. || es:K  || fr:K Contourner supplies a nonliteral regulatory sense and avoids the marked technical borrowing bypasser. || it:K Aggirare supplies a useful nonliteral regulatory sense and avoids the marked technical borrowing bypassare. || pt:K Contornar regras ou controles é uma escolha institucional útil e evita o anglicismo técnico bypassar.
it_fancy_vocab_064	To configure	de:D Konfigurieren is a transparent, standard technical cognate with ordinary transitive morphology and no selected configuration frame. || es:D Transparent technical cognate with standard morphology and no selected distinction from configurar. || fr:D Configurer is a transparent, standard technical cognate with ordinary transitive morphology and no selected configuration frame. || it:D Configurare is a transparent, standard technical cognate with ordinary transitive morphology and no selected configuration frame. || pt:D Configurar é um cognato técnico transparente e frequente, corretamente representado por old_back.
it_fancy_vocab_065	To propagate	de:K Neutral onward transmission is weiterverbreiten; the tempting cognate propagieren generally means actively advocating or proclaiming an idea. || es:D Transparent cognate; without a selected biological, technical or disinformation collocation, it offers little additional C1 value. || fr:D Propager is a transparent cognate, and the bare prompt selects no transitive, pronominal, technical or media-specific contrast. || it:D Propagare is a transparent cognate, and the bare prompt does not choose a transitive, pronominal, technical or media-specific use. || pt:D Propagar é um cognato transparente em redes, mídia e epidemiologia, e o original não seleciona um desses domínios.
it_fancy_vocab_066	To elucidate	de:K A complex mechanism is erläutert or verdeutlicht, while old_back aufklären more commonly means informing someone or resolving an unclear event. || es:K  || fr:K Formal élucider has a useful investigative register and a narrower range of questions, causes and mechanisms than generic expliquer. || it:K Natural Italian normally uses chiarire or formal delucidare; the tempting direct cognate elucidare exists but is rare. || pt:K O contraste de registro e colocação entre esclarecer e o cognato elevado elucidar tem valor para prosa analítica.
it_fancy_vocab_067	To preserve	de:D Bewahren and erhalten are familiar general verbs, and the isolated prompt does not choose a conservation, data-retention or rights-protection sense. || es:D Common transparent equivalent; the isolated prompt does not establish a specialized contrast between preservar and conservar. || fr:K The protection frame préserver quelque chose de contrasts usefully with simple retention or maintenance by conserver. || it:D Preservare is a familiar transparent equivalent, and the isolated prompt does not distinguish protection from retention, conservation or data preservation. || pt:D Preservar é um cognato frequente e transparente, sem objeto ou sentido especializado que acrescente uma lição C1.
it_fancy_vocab_068	To erode	de:K With an explicit agent erode trust or rights is idiomatically rendered as etwas schleichend aushöhlen; erodieren is more marked and specialist in that frame. || es:K  || fr:K The institutional metaphor and the contrast between transitive éroder and intransitive s’éroder provide genuine production value. || it:K Erodere has productive institutional collocations and the useful irregular past participle eroso, neither visible in the isolated infinitive. || pt:K Minar e corroer são escolhas figuradas idiomáticas com confiança e legitimidade, ao contrário do cognato técnico erodir.
it_fancy_vocab_069	To subscribe	de:K German abonnieren takes a direct accusative object, unlike the reflexive prepositional constructions familiar from several other learner languages. || es:K  || fr:K French distinguishes subscribing to a publication with s’abonner à from the contractual and intellectual senses of souscrire. || it:K The publication sense requires the pronominal governed frame abbonarsi a and contrasts with the intellectual and contractual senses of English subscribe. || pt:K Assinar um serviço distingue contratação recorrente de inscrever-se e das leituras proposicionais de subscrever ou aderir a.
it_fancy_vocab_070	To modify	de:D Verändern and anpassen are familiar general verbs, while the source supplies no technical or legal object that would select a narrower equivalent. || es:D Transparent high-frequency cognate with ordinary morphology and no specialized sense or government pattern in the prompt. || fr:D Modifier is a transparent, high-frequency cognate with ordinary morphology and no specialized sense or complement in the prompt. || it:D Modificare is a transparent, high-frequency cognate with ordinary morphology and no specialized object or complement selected by the prompt. || pt:D Modificar é um cognato geral transparente, de morfologia regular e sem construção específica no original.
it_fancy_vocab_071	To quantify	de:D Quantifizieren is a transparent academic cognate, and the prompt does not select the monetary or numerical collocations that would favor beziffern. || es:K  || fr:D Quantifier is a transparent academic cognate, and the isolated prompt supplies no measurement contrast beyond it. || it:D Quantificare is a transparent academic cognate, and the prompt does not select the damage, monetary or measurement frame that could add production value. || pt:D Quantificar é um cognato acadêmico transparente e o item não contrasta mensuração, estimativa ou monetização.
it_fancy_vocab_072	To retaliate	de:K German lacks an equally neutral one-word equivalent in geopolitical prose and instead uses the marked support-verb construction Vergeltung üben. || es:K  || fr:K Legacy rétorquer denotes a verbal retort, while geopolitical retaliation calls for riposter or measures of reprisal. || it:K Italian lacks an equally neutral one-word equivalent in geopolitical prose and instead uses support-verb frames built around ritorsione or contromisure. || pt:K Retaliar contra explicita a preposição do alvo e permite corrigir a redundância potencial de retaliar de volta.
it_fancy_vocab_073	To endorse	de:K Befürworten expresses approval, whereas the legacy unterstützen is broader and can denote practical help without endorsement. || es:K  || fr:K An explicit approval frame distinguishes endorsement from practical support and blocks the false friend endosser. || it:K Avallare expresses lending approval or legitimacy and distinguishes policy endorsement from practical support and the cheque sense of English endorse. || pt:K A escolha entre apoiar, endossar e recomendar varia com objeto e registro, distinção ausente do original.
it_fancy_vocab_074	To penalize	de:K In ranking and scoring contexts penalize often means benachteiligen rather than the explicit punishment conveyed by old_back bestrafen. || es:D Transparent cognate with ordinary morphology; the isolated prompt does not select a distinct legal or collocational issue. || fr:D Pénaliser is a transparent, frequent equivalent whose isolated prompt selects no distinct sanction or ranking sense. || it:D Penalizzare is a transparent, high-frequency cognate, and the source supplies no legal, scoring or algorithmic contrast beyond it. || pt:K Aplicar uma sanção a explicita a penalidade regulatória formal que o ambíguo penalizar pode não distinguir de simples prejuízo.
it_fancy_vocab_075	To synthesize	de:K Academic findings are idiomatically zusammengeführt or zu einem Gesamtbild verdichtet; synthetisieren is more technical and can sound calqued here. || es:D Transparent academic cognate accurately rendered by sintetizar; no specialized construction is selected by the bare prompt. || fr:D Synthétiser is a transparent academic cognate with ordinary morphology and no selected technical or review-specific frame. || it:D Sintetizzare is a transparent academic cognate with ordinary morphology and no specialized review or chemical sense selected here. || pt:D Sintetizar é um cognato acadêmico transparente e frequente, sem objeto que selecione composição química ou resumo analítico.
it_fancy_vocab_076	To authenticate	de:K The technical cognate supports a high-value distinction between verifying identity or authenticity and granting authorization. || es:K  || fr:K The standard technical verb supports a high-value distinction between authentication and authorization. || it:K The standard technical verb supports a high-value distinction between verifying identity or authenticity and granting authorization. || pt:K A distinção técnica entre autenticar uma identidade e autorizar seu acesso é produtiva em segurança digital.
it_fancy_vocab_077	To archive	de:D Archivieren is a transparent, high-frequency technical cognate with ordinary transitive morphology and an accurate legacy gloss. || es:D Transparent high-frequency technical cognate with ordinary morphology and no additional C1 production lesson. || fr:D Archiver is a transparent, high-frequency technical cognate with ordinary transitive morphology and an accurate legacy gloss. || it:D Archiviare is a transparent, high-frequency technical cognate with ordinary transitive morphology and an accurate legacy gloss. || pt:D Arquivar é um equivalente direto e frequente, sem contraste selecionado entre preservação, armazenamento e encerramento administrativo.
it_fancy_vocab_078	To delegate	de:K The productive frame etwas an jemanden delegieren teaches recipient government and contrasts with jemandem etwas übertragen. || es:D Transparent institutional cognate accurately represented by delegar, with no selected government, register or sense distinction. || fr:K The task-and-recipient frame déléguer quelque chose à quelqu’un adds useful government absent from the legacy headword. || it:K The productive frame delegare qualcosa a qualcuno teaches recipient government and contrasts with directly delegating a person as representative. || pt:K Delegar algo a alguém ensina a estrutura de dois complementos e a preposição exigida diante do destinatário.
it_fancy_vocab_079	To devalue	de:D Abwerten is a familiar direct equivalent, while the bare prompt does not distinguish currency depreciation, disparagement or loss of symbolic value. || es:K  || fr:K Currency dévaluer contrasts with general dévaloriser and market-driven se déprécier, making the source polysemy worth teaching. || it:K Intentional currency svalutare contrasts with market-driven deprezzarsi, while the English source also has broader figurative senses. || pt:D Desvalorizar é um equivalente transparente e frequente, e o item não escolhe entre moeda, ativo, reputação ou forma pronominal.
it_fancy_vocab_080	To prioritize	de:K Old_back names setting priorities generally, whereas the English verb needs a transitive frame that can contrast one object with another. || es:K  || fr:K Giving operational priority differs from merely ranking items with legacy hiérarchiser; the idiomatic frame is donner la priorité à. || it:K Dare priorità a supplies a natural governed frame and usefully contrasts with transitive privilegiare and more managerial prioritizzare. || pt:K O contraste entre dar prioridade a e priorizar ensina duas estruturas produtivas com regências diferentes.

## b03
it_fancy_vocab_081	To transcend	de:K German analytical prose normally uses the separable governed frame über etwas hinausgehen; the legacy cognate is markedly theoretical. || es:K  || fr:K The marked formal verb has a useful abstract sense and a direct-transitive pattern that must be distinguished from se transcender. || it:K Trascendere has a sustained transitive sense, scendere-like morphology and a distinct absolute sense of losing restraint, giving the cognate real production value. || pt:K A construção transitiva e a redundância frequente de transcender para além de oferecem uma lição produtiva além do cognato.
it_fancy_vocab_082	To immerse	de:K The sustained-study sense teaches the reflexive in-plus-accusative construction sich in etwas vertiefen and contrasts with transitive vertiefen. || es:K  || fr:K The intended experiential sense requires the pronominal governed frame s’immerger dans, which old_back does not supply. || it:K The experiential sense requires the pronominal governed frame immergersi in, whereas the legacy bare transitive verb normally takes the thing being submerged as its object. || pt:K Mergulhar em fixa a leitura figurada idiomática e evita tanto o para indevido de old_back quanto interferência pronominal das outras línguas.
it_fancy_vocab_083	To simulate	de:D Simulieren is a transparent, high-frequency cognate that covers the ordinary modeling and feigning senses, while the bare prompt selects no narrower usage issue. || es:D Transparent, high-frequency cognate accurately rendered by simular; the isolated prompt selects no narrower sense or production trap. || fr:D Simuler is a transparent, high-frequency technical cognate with ordinary transitive morphology and no selected narrower sense. || it:D Simulare is a transparent, high-frequency academic and technical cognate with ordinary transitive morphology and no narrower sense selected by the isolated prompt. || pt:D Simular é um cognato transparente, frequente e de morfologia regular, sem sentido técnico ou contraste selecionado pelo item isolado.
it_fancy_vocab_084	To juxtapose	de:K Analytical juxtaposition is idiomatically gegenüberstellen, a separable verb with a useful dative comparator; old_back can describe merely placing things side by side. || es:K  || fr:K The analytical construction juxtaposer A à B adds useful government and blocks interference from Spanish yuxtaponer. || it:K Giustapporre teaches the a-complement for the second element and the irregular past participle giustapposto, both absent from the legacy infinitive. || pt:K Justapor ensina a grafia com s, a regência com a e formas irregulares herdadas de pôr, como justapõe e justapôs.
it_fancy_vocab_085	To overshadow	de:K The figurative frame etwas in den Schatten stellen teaches separable morphology and a useful contrast with the negative-pall sense often carried by überschatten. || es:K  || fr:K The figurative attention-displacing sense requires nonliteral éclipser or occulter rather than a word built on French ombre. || it:K Mettere in ombra is a productive nonliteral expression for displacing attention and prevents an unsafe extension of literal ombreggiare. || pt:K Ofuscar ou eclipsar algo fixa o sentido figurado de retirar destaque, que não decorre com segurança de uma tradução literal de shadow.
it_fancy_vocab_086	To compartmentalize	de:K The psychological sense requires an idiomatic paraphrase such as etwas gedanklich von etwas trennen; legacy kompartimentieren is specialist jargon. || es:K  || fr:K Organizational French often prefers cloisonner, while legacy compartimenter is more technical and an English-based derived form is unsafe. || it:K Institutional separation is naturally expressed by tenere separato or a compartimenti stagni, while legacy compartimentare is more technical and often physical. || pt:K O verbo marcado distingue isolamento funcional de mera divisão ou classificação e tem uso produtivo em segurança e gestão institucional.
it_fancy_vocab_087	To interconnect	de:K The item teaches the reciprocal miteinander or asymmetric mit-plus-dative construction omitted by the bare legacy verb. || es:K  || fr:D Interconnecter is a transparent, standard technical cognate with ordinary transitive morphology; the isolated prompt selects no distinct reciprocal frame. || it:D Interconnettere is a transparent, standard technical cognate, and the bare source selects neither a reciprocal pronominal construction nor a specialized network relation. || pt:K Interligar é uma forma brasileira menos marcada e explicita a relação em rede, enquanto old_back acrescenta para indevidamente.
it_fancy_vocab_088	To contextualize	de:K In einen größeren Zusammenhang einordnen is the idiomatic neutral-formal rendering and supplies separable morphology absent from the malformed legacy headword. || es:K  || fr:K Replacer quelque chose dans son contexte supplies a productive, less jargony frame alongside the transparent academic cognate. || it:D Contestualizzare is a transparent, frequent academic cognate with ordinary transitive syntax and no additional production issue in the isolated prompt. || pt:K A distinção entre situar nas circunstâncias relevantes e justificar ou relativizar uma conduta tem valor analítico real.
it_fancy_vocab_089	To deviate	de:K Von etwas abweichen teaches dative government together with strong, separable morphology concealed by the isolated source. || es:K  || fr:K Abstract departure teaches s’écarter de and distinguishes it from non-pronominal dévier and other senses of the English verb. || it:K Departing from an established policy or standard is naturally discostarsi da, a pronominal governed frame not supplied by the bare legacy verb. || pt:K No sentido institucional de afastamento de um padrão, o português exige a construção pronominal desviar-se de, ausente de old_back.
it_fancy_vocab_090	To extrapolate	de:D Extrapolieren is a transparent academic cognate, and the bare prompt does not select a statistical, predictive or looser inferential frame. || es:D Transparent academic cognate accurately rendered by extrapolar; the bare prompt supplies no statistical, predictive or collocational distinction. || fr:D Extrapoler is a transparent academic cognate, and the bare source does not select a statistical, predictive or looser inferential construction. || it:D Estrapolare is a transparent academic cognate, and the bare prompt does not select a statistical source, predictive use or complement worth isolating. || pt:D Extrapolar é um cognato acadêmico transparente, e o original não seleciona uma leitura estatística, preditiva ou de transgressão de limites.
it_fancy_vocab_091	To resonate	de:K Figurative public resonance is idiomatically Widerhall finden or auf Resonanz stoßen; old_back is unnatural in this sense. || es:K  || fr:K Audience response is idiomatically trouver un écho auprès de, rather than the literal acoustic reading suggested by old_back. || it:K Audience response is idiomatically trovare eco presso or avere risonanza presso, rather than a mechanical figurative extension of risuonare con. || pt:K Encontrar eco em um público fixa a recepção figurada de ideias ou demandas sem depender do cognato mais literal ressoar.
it_fancy_vocab_092	To fragment	de:D Fragmentieren is a transparent academic and technical cognate; the retained noun Zersplitterung carries the more useful social-analysis distinction in this chunk. || es:D Transparent cognate with ordinary morphology; the useful social-analysis noun fragmentación is retained later in this chunk, so the verb adds no distinct lesson. || fr:D Fragmenter is a transparent cognate with ordinary morphology; the more useful social-analysis noun fragmentation is retained later in this chunk. || it:D Frammentare is a transparent cognate with ordinary morphology; the later noun note retains the structural concept and adds a useful contrast with frammentarietà. || pt:D Fragmentar é um cognato transparente de morfologia regular; o substantivo crítico fragmentação é retido mais adiante com uma distinção conceitual própria.
it_fancy_vocab_093	To synchronize	de:D Synchronisieren is a transparent, high-frequency technical cognate with ordinary transitive morphology and no selected production trap. || es:D Transparent, high-frequency technical cognate accurately rendered by sincronizar, with no selected reflexive, government or register issue. || fr:D Synchroniser is a transparent, high-frequency technical cognate with no selected government, register or semantic contrast. || it:D Sincronizzare is a transparent, high-frequency technical cognate, and the isolated source supplies no selected reciprocal, temporal or system-specific construction. || pt:D Sincronizar é um cognato técnico transparente e frequente, sem regência, sentido ou contraste adicional selecionado pelo item.
