it_fancy_vocab_133	the Malleability	de:K Formbarkeit is a useful non-cognate for abstract systems and institutions, while Malleabilität is largely restricted to technical material properties. || es:K The term has high-value abstract use for rules and institutions, where maleabilidad is more precise than the broader flexibilidad. || fr:K The abstract use of malléabilité for rules and institutions supports a useful distinction from broader flexibilité and adds a productive de complement. || it:K The abstract use of malleabilità for rules and institutions supports a useful distinction from broader flessibilità and supplies real analytical value. || pt:K O uso abstrato de maleabilidade para regras e instituições ensina a capacidade de ser moldado por pressões, mais específica do que flexibilidade.
