it_fancy_vocab_135	the Fluidity	de:K Social-theory fluidity is Fluidität; legacy Flüchtigkeit instead means transience, volatility or inattentiveness. || es:K The social-theory sense of fluidez is useful and must be separated from fluidez verbal, liquid flow and the stronger instability implied by volatilidad. || fr:K The social-theory sense of fluidité usefully foregrounds ease of movement or change and must be distinguished from stronger instabilité. || it:K The social-theory sense of fluidità usefully foregrounds ease of movement or change and must be distinguished from stronger instabilità. || pt:K A fluidez de relações e categorias é produtiva em teoria social e não deve ser confundida automaticamente com instabilidade ou volatilidade.
