it_fancy_vocab_158	the Consumerism	de:K Konsumismus fixes the critical consumption-centered sense and must not be overextended to English consumer-advocacy uses. || es:K Consumismo fixes the critical consumption-centred sense and must be distinguished from neutral consumo and consumer advocacy. || fr:K Consumérisme fixes a critical consumption-centered sense but is genuinely polysemous in French, where it can also denote consumer advocacy. || it:K Consumismo fixes the critical consumption-centered sense and must be distinguished from neutral consumo and consumerismo as organized consumer advocacy. || pt:K Consumismo fixa o sentido crítico de consumo excessivo e precisa ser distinguido de consumo neutro e de consumerismo como defesa dos interesses do consumidor.
