it_fancy_vocab_160	the Exploitation	de:K The item teaches the negative force of Ausbeutung and the need for Nutzung or Verwertung when English exploitation is technically neutral. || es:K The item teaches the negative force of explotación and the need to distinguish abusive labour use from neutral resource extraction or aprovechamiento. || fr:K The item teaches the critical labor sense of exploitation and its important contrast with semantically neutral technical and extractive uses in French. || it:K The item teaches the critical labor sense of sfruttamento and its important contrast with neutral technical uses and the false rendering esplorazione. || pt:K Exploração é altamente polissêmica; o sentido de abuso precisa ser distinguido de extração neutra e até do inglês exploration em certos contextos.

