REG=Written-formal in media theory and criticism for an apparently direct, unmediated experience or relationship.
TRAP=Immediacy here means lack of mediation or distance, not urgency; the latter is Dringlichkeit in German.
EX=Die vermeintliche Unmittelbarkeit von Livestreams verdeckt, dass Auswahl, Kameraführung und algorithmische Verbreitung die Wahrnehmung politischer Ereignisse entscheidend prägen.
EN=The apparent immediacy of livestreams obscures the fact that selection, camera work and algorithmic distribution decisively shape perceptions of political events.
