NEG de_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_311 True False Eine Nachfrageprognose bleibt wertlos, wenn sie saisonale Schwankungen ignoriert und die Anreize der Vertriebsabteilung bei der Datenerhebung nicht berücksichtigt. || A demand forecast remains worthless if it ignores seasonal fluctuations and fails to account for the sales department's incentives when collecting data.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_328 False True Wenn Plattformen private Nachrichten ohne richterliche Kontrolle auswerten, verstoßen sie gegen Grundrechte und untergraben das Vertrauen ihrer Nutzer. || When platforms analyze private messages without judicial oversight, they violate fundamental rights and undermine their users' trust.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b10_notes it_fancy_vocab_364 False True Responsive Benutzeroberflächen passen sich verschiedenen Bildschirmgrößen an, ohne die Informationshierarchie durch dekorative Elemente zu verwässern oder zentrale Funktionen hinter Menüs zu verstecken. || Responsive user interfaces adapt to different screen sizes without diluting the information hierarchy through decorative elements or hiding core functions behind menus.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b10_notes it_fancy_vocab_371 False True Kollaborative Entwicklungsmodelle verteilen Verantwortung auf Teams, ohne die strategische Entscheidungsmacht automatisch demokratischer oder transparenter für Nutzer und Öffentlichkeit zu machen. || Collaborative development models distribute responsibility among teams without automatically making strategic decision-making more democratic or transparent to users and the public.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b10_notes it_fancy_vocab_393 False True Ohne klare Rechenschaftspflicht bleiben automatisierte Entscheidungen politisch folgenlos, selbst wenn unabhängige Prüfstellen ihre diskriminierenden Auswirkungen dokumentieren und veröffentlichen. || Without clear accountability, automated decisions remain politically consequence-free even when independent review bodies document and publish their discriminatory effects.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_405 False True Die Studie formuliert präzise, warum offene Standards demokratische Kontrolle stärken, ohne technische Komplexität vorschnell als bloßes Verwaltungsproblem abzutun. || The study articulates precisely why open standards strengthen democratic oversight without prematurely dismissing technical complexity as a mere administrative problem.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_406 False True Die Gewerkschaft macht sich für verbindliche Mitbestimmungsrechte stark, weil algorithmische Personalentscheidungen zunehmend viele Beschäftigte direkt ohne Widerspruchsmöglichkeit treffen. || The union champions binding co-determination rights because algorithmic personnel decisions increasingly affect many employees directly without any opportunity to appeal.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_420 False True Die Ministerin wies die Kritik zurück, statt sie als bloße Kampagne ausländischer Interessen abzutun, ohne ihre Belege ernsthaft zu prüfen. || The minister dismissed the criticism instead of writing it off as a mere campaign by foreign interests without seriously examining its evidence.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_437 False True Die Regierung will den Ausbau erneuerbarer Energien vorantreiben, ohne lokale Gemeinden an den Entscheidungen über neue Leitungen zu beteiligen. || The government wants to promote the expansion of renewable energy without involving local communities in decisions about new power lines.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_469 False True Der Kommentar deutete an, dass die Reform vor allem oppositionelle Regionen benachteilige, ohne diese Anschuldigung offen zu formulieren. || The comment insinuated that the reform disadvantaged opposition regions above all, without stating the accusation openly.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_474 False True Die Regierung verkündete die neue Verordnung, ohne die betroffenen Kommunen ausreichend zu konsultieren oder ihre Finanzierung transparent offenzulegen. || The government promulgated the new regulation without sufficiently consulting the affected municipalities or transparently disclosing its financing.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_483 True False Aus den widersprüchlichen Aussagen vermutete die Analystin, dass der Rücktritt auf internen Druck und nicht auf gesundheitliche Gründe zurückzuführen war. || From the contradictory statements, the analyst surmised that the resignation was due to internal pressure rather than health reasons.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_493 False True Die Kritik des Berichts überzeugte, weil sie methodische Schwächen benannte, ohne die betroffenen Forscher pauschal der Täuschung zu bezichtigen. || The critique of the report was persuasive because it identified methodological weaknesses without broadly accusing the researchers concerned of deception.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_511 True False Der Vorschlag, unabhängige Aufsichtsbehörden mit verbindlichen Prüfungsfristen auszustatten, erhielt im Parlament trotz parteiübergreifender Unterstützung keine Mehrheit bei der Abstimmung. || The proposal to equip independent regulators with binding review deadlines failed to win a majority in parliament despite cross-party support.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_512 False True Die Erwiderung der Verteidigung wies auf methodische Lücken hin, ohne die zentralen Zeugenaussagen des Anklägers vollständig zu widerlegen. || The defense's rebuttal pointed to methodological gaps without fully refuting the prosecutor's central witness statements.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_516 False True Unter der Annahme, dass die Nachfrage stabil bleibt, könnte die Behörde die Investitionen schrittweise erhöhen, ohne den Haushalt zu überlasten. || On the supposition that demand remains stable, the authority could gradually increase investment without overburdening the budget.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_518 False True Die zentrale These der Dissertation lautet, dass Transparenz ohne wirksame Sanktionen institutionelle Macht kaum nachhaltig begrenzt oder kontrolliert. || The dissertation's central thesis is that transparency without effective sanctions scarcely limits or controls institutional power sustainably.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b14_notes it_fancy_vocab_526 False True Die Darlegung der Kommission verbindet historische Belege mit aktuellen Daten, ohne die politischen Zielkonflikte hinter technischen Begriffen zu verbergen. || The commission's exposition combines historical evidence with current data without concealing political trade-offs behind technical terms.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b15_notes it_fancy_vocab_567 False True Eine nuancierte Berichterstattung muss zivile Opfer benennen, ohne die komplexen historischen Verantwortlichkeiten des Konflikts auf ein einziges Narrativ zu verkürzen. || Nuanced reporting must name civilian casualties without reducing the conflict's complex historical responsibilities to a single narrative.
NEG de_fancy_vocab_b15_notes it_fancy_vocab_572 False True Ein pragmatischer Regulierungsvorschlag akzeptiert politische Kompromisse, ohne die langfristigen Machtasymmetrien zwischen Plattformen, Staaten und einzelnen Nutzern aus dem Blick zu verlieren. || A pragmatic regulatory proposal accepts political compromises without losing sight of the long-term power asymmetries among platforms, states and individual users.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_002 False True La Unión Europea pretende regular los sistemas de recomendación sin imponer un modelo editorial único a todas las plataformas del continente. || The European Union intends to regulate recommendation systems without imposing a single editorial model on every platform on the continent.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_007 False True El Gobierno privatizó la infraestructura de pagos sin establecer salvaguardias que impidieran que el nuevo operador excluyera a competidores y encareciera el servicio. || The government privatized the payment infrastructure without establishing safeguards to prevent the new operator from excluding competitors and making the service more expensive.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_023 False True Los medios locales se adaptaron a las nuevas reglas de distribución sin renunciar a investigar a los actores que financiaban la plataforma. || Local media adapted to the new distribution rules without giving up investigating the actors that financed the platform.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_024 False True La comisión aplicó las nuevas salvaguardias de forma gradual para que los medios pequeños pudieran cumplirlas sin abandonar servicios esenciales. || The commission implemented the new safeguards gradually so that small media outlets could comply with them without abandoning essential services.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_026 False True El Estado invirtió en centros públicos de datos para reducir la dependencia tecnológica sin subvencionar otra generación de proveedores dominantes. || The state invested in public data centers to reduce technological dependence without subsidizing another generation of dominant providers.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_043 False True La redacción incrustó el vídeo original en la investigación interactiva para que los lectores pudieran revisar la evidencia sin abandonar la página. || The newsroom embedded the original video in the interactive investigation so that readers could review the evidence without leaving the page.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_046 False True Los medios públicos deben aprovechar sus archivos históricos sin convertirlos en una fuente opaca de entrenamiento para modelos comerciales. || Public media outlets should leverage their historical archives without turning them into an opaque source of training data for commercial models.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_056 False True Las redacciones pequeñas deben desenvolverse en un mercado dominado por plataformas que cambian sus condiciones comerciales sin previo aviso. || Small newsrooms must navigate a market dominated by platforms that change their commercial terms without warning.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_066 False True El informe dilucida qué mecanismos permitieron que una campaña coordinada alterase el debate público sin dejar una huella financiera evidente. || The report elucidates which mechanisms allowed a coordinated campaign to alter public debate without leaving an evident financial trail.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_068 False True La opacidad erosiona la confianza ciudadana cuando las instituciones publican cifras sin explicar los criterios empleados para producirlas. || Opacity erodes public trust when institutions publish figures without explaining the criteria used to produce them.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_071 False True La investigación cuantifica el coste democrático de la desinformación sin reducir sus efectos a una sola métrica de audiencia. || The research quantifies the democratic cost of disinformation without reducing its effects to a single audience metric.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b03_notes it_fancy_vocab_087 False True La nueva norma obliga a interconectar los registros públicos con sistemas de verificación, ampliando la trazabilidad sin resolver quién controla esos cruces. || The new rule requires public registers to be interconnected with verification systems, increasing traceability without resolving who controls those cross-checks.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b03_notes it_fancy_vocab_089 False True La plataforma se desvió de sus propios criterios de moderación cuando varios gobiernos exigieron retirar contenidos incómodos sin dar explicaciones públicas. || The platform deviated from its own moderation criteria when several governments demanded the removal of inconvenient content without giving public explanations.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b04_notes it_fancy_vocab_135 False True La fluidez de las identidades políticas se hace visible cuando los votantes combinan demandas incompatibles sin adoptar una afiliación estable. || The fluidity of political identities becomes visible when voters combine incompatible demands without adopting a stable affiliation.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b04_notes it_fancy_vocab_139 False True La agregación de datos permite comparar tendencias regionales sin exponer cada registro individual, siempre que el diseño preserve los límites de reidentificación. || Data aggregation makes it possible to compare regional trends without exposing each individual record, provided the design preserves re-identification limits.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b05_notes it_fancy_vocab_175 False True La netiqueta profesional exige corregir información falsa sin humillar al interlocutor, especialmente cuando el debate público ya está marcado por la polarización. || Professional netiquette requires correcting false information without humiliating the other person, especially when public debate is already marked by polarization.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b05_notes it_fancy_vocab_177 False True La extralimitación del regulador debilitó una sentencia necesaria, pues el tribunal concluyó que había impuesto obligaciones sin respaldo legal suficiente. || The regulator's overreach weakened a necessary ruling, since the court concluded that it had imposed obligations without sufficient legal basis.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_205 False True El efecto insidioso de la personalización consiste en reducir paulatinamente la diversidad informativa sin que el usuario perciba una restricción explícita. || The insidious effect of personalisation consists in gradually reducing information diversity without the user perceiving an explicit restriction.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_209 True False La vigilancia generalizada altera la conducta pública incluso cuando nadie sabe qué datos se recogen, durante cuánto tiempo ni con qué finalidad. || Pervasive surveillance alters public behaviour even when nobody knows what data is collected, for how long or for what purpose.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_222 False True El discurso proteico del movimiento adopta un lenguaje ecologista, nacionalista o tecnocrático según la audiencia, sin modificar su estructura de poder. || The movement's protean discourse adopts environmentalist, nationalist or technocratic language depending on the audience, without changing its power structure.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b07_notes it_fancy_vocab_245 False True Los aranceles sobre componentes electrónicos encarecieron la producción nacional sin crear proveedores alternativos, porque las empresas siguieron dependiendo de maquinaria importada. || Tariffs on electronic components made domestic production more expensive without creating alternative suppliers, because companies remained dependent on imported machinery.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b07_notes it_fancy_vocab_260 False True Los estándares técnicos abiertos reducen la dependencia de un proveedor y permiten que administraciones distintas intercambien datos sin adoptar sistemas idénticos. || Open technical standards reduce dependence on one supplier and allow different public administrations to exchange data without adopting identical systems.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_307 False True La logística de terceros (3PL) permitió abrir nuevos mercados sin construir almacenes propios, aunque dificultó supervisar los retrasos y gestionar las devoluciones. || Third-party logistics (3PL) made it possible to enter new markets without building warehouses, although it made delays harder to monitor and returns harder to manage.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_310 False True Cada referencia interna (SKU) distingue talla y color, de modo que el comercio puede reponer una variante sin confundirla con productos similares. || Each stock keeping unit (SKU) distinguishes size and colour, allowing the retailer to replenish one variant without confusing it with similar products.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_405 False True La ministra formuló con claridad sus reservas sobre el pacto, sin convertir una discrepancia técnica en una ruptura política irreversible. || The minister articulated her reservations about the pact clearly, without turning a technical disagreement into an irreversible political rupture.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_420 False True El comité descartó las objeciones de los expertos sin explicar por qué consideraba suficientes las garantías ofrecidas por el proveedor. || The committee dismissed the experts' objections without explaining why it considered the safeguards offered by the provider sufficient.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_430 True False Los investigadores formularon la hipótesis de que el descenso del tráfico obedecía a cambios algorítmicos y no a una menor demanda informativa. || The researchers hypothesized that the decline in traffic was due to algorithmic changes rather than lower demand for news.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_465 False True Durante la comparecencia, el ministro insistió machaconamente en el coste de la transición, sin mencionar los subsidios concedidos a las empresas contaminantes. || During the hearing, the minister harped on the cost of the transition without mentioning the subsidies granted to polluting companies.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_483 True False Los analistas conjeturaron que el apagón había sido deliberado, aunque la ausencia de registros impedía atribuirlo con rigor a ningún actor. || The analysts surmised that the outage had been deliberate, although the lack of records prevented them from rigorously attributing it to any actor.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_487 False True La campaña demonizó a las organizaciones humanitarias, presentándolas como cómplices de las redes criminales sin aportar pruebas de esa colaboración. || The campaign vilified humanitarian organizations, portraying them as accomplices of criminal networks without providing evidence of that collaboration.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b14_notes it_fancy_vocab_539 True False El comité presentó un argumento sólido y convincente contra el reconocimiento facial, apoyado en auditorías independientes y no en temores meramente hipotéticos. || The committee presented a cogent argument against facial recognition, grounded in independent audits rather than merely hypothetical fears.
NEG es_fancy_vocab_b15_notes it_fancy_vocab_567 False True El diagnóstico matizado reconoce que la moderación automática reduce ciertos abusos, pero también amplifica sesgos cuando opera sin supervisión humana efectiva. || The nuanced assessment acknowledges that automated moderation reduces certain abuses but also amplifies biases when it operates without effective human oversight.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_002 False True L’Union européenne a réglementé les systèmes de recommandation afin d’imposer des obligations de transparence sans prescrire une ligne éditoriale commune aux plateformes. || The European Union regulated recommendation systems to impose transparency obligations without prescribing a common editorial line for the platforms.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_023 False True Les médias indépendants se sont adaptés aux nouvelles règles de distribution sans soumettre leur travail d’enquête aux priorités opaques imposées par les plateformes. || Independent media adapted to the new distribution rules without subordinating their investigative work to the opaque priorities imposed by platforms.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_026 False True L’État a investi dans des centres de données publics afin de réduire sa dépendance technologique sans subventionner une nouvelle génération de fournisseurs dominants. || The state invested in public data centers to reduce its technological dependence without subsidizing a new generation of dominant providers.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_031 False True La concentration du marché publicitaire numérique sape l’indépendance éditoriale, car quelques intermédiaires peuvent sanctionner économiquement les médias critiques sans imposer la moindre interdiction formelle. || Concentration in the digital advertising market undermines editorial independence because a few intermediaries can punish critical media economically without imposing any formal ban.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_036 True False Les chercheurs indépendants n’ont accédé aux journaux techniques internes qu’après qu’un tribunal a contraint la plateforme à conserver l’ensemble des éléments de preuve. || Independent researchers accessed the internal technical logs only after a court compelled the platform to preserve all the evidence.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_041 False True La rédaction sélectionne et éditorialise des contenus issus d’archives décentralisées afin de documenter la campagne sans reproduire les hiérarchies imposées par les plateformes. || The editorial team curates content from decentralized archives to document the campaign without reproducing the hierarchies imposed by the platforms.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_043 False True Le média a intégré la vidéo originale à son enquête interactive, permettant aux lecteurs de vérifier les images sans quitter la page. || The media outlet embedded the original video in its interactive investigation, allowing readers to verify the footage without leaving the page.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_044 False True La nouvelle base de signalements interagit avec les systèmes municipaux au moyen d’une interface documentée, sans transmettre leurs identifiants aux prestataires privés. || The new reporting database interfaces with municipal systems through a documented interface without passing their identifiers to private contractors.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_066 False True Le rapport élucide les mécanismes par lesquels les algorithmes recommandent certains contenus politiques, sans révéler de données permettant d’identifier les utilisateurs. || The report elucidates the mechanisms by which algorithms recommend certain political content without revealing data that could identify users.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b03_notes it_fancy_vocab_116 False True Les journalistes ont vérifié l’authenticité des vidéos avant publication, sans pouvoir confirmer la véracité des légendes ajoutées par les comptes qui les diffusaient. || The journalists verified the videos’ authenticity before publication without being able to confirm the truthfulness of the captions added by the accounts distributing them.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b04_notes it_fancy_vocab_135 False True La fluidité des appartenances politiques favorise des coalitions inédites, sans supprimer les clivages sociaux durables qui continuent d’organiser le vote. || The fluidity of political affiliations fosters novel coalitions without erasing the enduring social divisions that continue to structure voting.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b04_notes it_fancy_vocab_142 False True La réciprocité entre les deux États demeure fragile, car chacun exige des concessions commerciales sans offrir de garanties de sécurité équivalentes. || Reciprocity between the two states remains fragile because each demands trade concessions without offering equivalent security guarantees.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b04_notes it_fancy_vocab_156 False True La normalisation des interfaces ouvertes réduit les coûts de changement de fournisseur, à condition que les spécifications soient élaborées publiquement et appliquées sans discrimination. || The standardization of open interfaces reduces switching costs, provided the specifications are developed publicly and applied without discrimination.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b05_notes it_fancy_vocab_168 False True Les natifs du numérique maîtrisent souvent les codes des plateformes, sans pour autant comprendre les modèles économiques qui organisent leur visibilité. || Digital natives often master platform conventions without necessarily understanding the business models that organize their visibility.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b05_notes it_fancy_vocab_177 False True L’abus de pouvoir du régulateur devient manifeste lorsqu’il impose des obligations sans base légale et soustrait ses décisions à tout contrôle juridictionnel. || The regulator’s overreach becomes clear when it imposes obligations without a legal basis and shields its decisions from any judicial review.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b05_notes it_fancy_vocab_189 True False Un modèle économique de rupture ne transforme réellement le secteur que s’il redistribue le pouvoir de marché, au lieu de moderniser seulement l’interface. || A disruptive business model truly transforms the sector only if it redistributes market power rather than merely modernizing the interface.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_205 True False Une dépendance insidieuse s’installe lorsque les administrations adoptent des outils propriétaires dont les coûts de sortie n’apparaissent qu’après plusieurs années. || An insidious dependency takes hold when government agencies adopt proprietary tools whose exit costs become apparent only after several years.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_209 False True Une surveillance généralisée modifie les comportements politiques, même lorsque les citoyens ignorent quelles données sont conservées ou croisées par les plateformes. || Pervasive surveillance changes political behavior even when citizens do not know which data the platforms retain or cross-reference.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_224 False True Un résultat anormal dans les données électorales exige un audit méthodique, sans justifier à lui seul des accusations publiques de fraude. || An anomalous result in electoral data calls for a methodical audit without by itself justifying public accusations of fraud.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_226 False True Cette concentration sans précédent donne à deux entreprises le pouvoir de modifier les règles d’accès à l’information sans véritable négociation publique. || This unprecedented concentration gives two companies the power to change the rules of access to information without genuine public negotiation.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b07_notes it_fancy_vocab_245 False True Les droits de douane imposés sur les véhicules électriques risquent de renchérir la transition écologique sans rétablir durablement les capacités industrielles européennes. || Tariffs imposed on electric vehicles risk making the green transition more expensive without sustainably restoring European industrial capacity.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b07_notes it_fancy_vocab_252 False True La réglementation des plateformes devrait garantir l’accès des chercheurs aux données, sans permettre aux entreprises de choisir seules les questions jugées légitimes. || Platform regulations should guarantee researchers access to data without allowing companies alone to decide which questions are considered legitimate.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b07_notes it_fancy_vocab_259 True False L’informatique quantique pourrait fragiliser certains systèmes cryptographiques, mais son calendrier industriel reste bien plus incertain que ne le suggèrent les annonces. || Quantum computing could weaken some cryptographic systems, but its industrial timeline remains far more uncertain than announcements suggest.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b07_notes it_fancy_vocab_260 False True Les normes techniques européennes peuvent orienter le marché mondial lorsque leur adoption garantit l’interopérabilité sans favoriser discrètement un fournisseur particulier. || European technical standards can shape the global market when their adoption guarantees interoperability without discreetly favoring a particular supplier.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_287 False True Un système sur puce, ou SoC, réunit un processeur, de la mémoire et plusieurs interfaces sur un même composant, réduisant l’encombrement sans supprimer la dépendance aux fondeurs. || A system on a chip, or SoC, combines a processor, memory, and several interfaces on a single component, reducing bulk without eliminating dependence on foundries.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_295 False True Le traitement automatique du langage naturel permet d’analyser des millions de commentaires, sans pour autant saisir l’ironie politique propre à chaque communauté. || Natural language processing makes it possible to analyze millions of comments without necessarily grasping the political irony specific to each community.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_307 False True L’entreprise recourt à la logistique externalisée : un prestataire 3PL coordonne l’entreposage et le transport sans devenir propriétaire des marchandises. || The company uses third-party logistics: a 3PL provider coordinates warehousing and transport without taking ownership of the goods.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_320 False True Certaines plateformes tirent profit de contenus trompeurs, puisque l’indignation augmente le temps d’écran sans qu’elles assument le coût social de cette amplification. || Some platforms profit from misleading content because outrage increases screen time without their bearing the social cost of that amplification.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_328 False True La collecte de données biométriques sans finalité précise porte atteinte à la vie privée, même lorsque l’entreprise promet un stockage sécurisé. || Collecting biometric data without a specific purpose violates privacy, even when the company promises secure storage.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_337 False True Le ministère s’est associé à deux opérateurs privés, sans publier les clauses qui encadrent l’usage secondaire des données scolaires. || The ministry partnered with two private operators without publishing the clauses governing the secondary use of school data.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_339 False True Après des mois de négociation, le consortium a obtenu un financement public sans accepter de contrôle indépendant sur ses pratiques de sous-traitance. || After months of negotiation, the consortium secured public funding without accepting independent oversight of its subcontracting practices.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_346 False True Le comité estime que l’exploitation de conversations privées pour entraîner un produit commercial sans consentement réellement éclairé est contraire à l’éthique. || The committee considers using private conversations to train a commercial product without genuinely informed consent to be unethical.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_356 True False Une messagerie sécurisée ne protège réellement ses usagers que si le chiffrement couvre aussi les sauvegardes et les métadonnées conservées par l’opérateur. || A secure messaging service truly protects its users only if encryption also covers backups and metadata retained by the operator.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b10_notes it_fancy_vocab_365 False True Son analyse reste suffisamment distanciée pour examiner les intérêts économiques du média sans adopter le récit rassurant proposé par sa direction. || Her analysis remains sufficiently detached to examine the media outlet’s economic interests without adopting the reassuring narrative offered by its management.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b10_notes it_fancy_vocab_373 False True Le modèle reste fortement consommateur de ressources, puisqu’il multiplie les centres de données sans imposer de plafond à leur consommation énergétique. || The model remains highly resource-intensive because it multiplies data centers without imposing any cap on their energy consumption.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b10_notes it_fancy_vocab_377 False True La réglementation sur les services numériques impose des obligations particulières aux grandes plateformes, sans interdire pour autant tous les modèles publicitaires ciblés. || Digital-services regulation imposes specific obligations on large platforms without, however, banning every targeted-advertising model.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b10_notes it_fancy_vocab_389 False True Le bénéfice trimestriel a doublé, non parce que le service s’est amélioré, mais parce que l’entreprise a réduit ses dépenses de modération. || Quarterly profit doubled not because the service improved, but because the company reduced its moderation spending.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_405 False True La ministre formulera clairement les conditions d’un accord, sans masquer les concessions budgétaires que chaque État devrait accepter pour le rendre viable. || The minister will clearly articulate the conditions of an agreement without concealing the budgetary concessions that each state would have to accept to make it viable.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_421 False True L’entreprise conteste les conclusions du régulateur, sans toutefois fournir les journaux techniques qui permettraient de vérifier sa propre version des incidents. || The company disputes the regulator’s conclusions without, however, providing the technical logs that would make it possible to verify its own account of the incidents.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_436 False True L’étude postule que les utilisateurs agissent rationnellement, sans examiner comment l’opacité des interfaces limite leur capacité à comparer réellement les offres. || The study posits that users act rationally without examining how opaque interfaces limit their ability to genuinely compare offers.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_440 False True Le rapport remet en question l’idée que l’autorégulation protège suffisamment les mineurs, sans pour autant recommander une interdiction générale des réseaux sociaux. || The report questions the idea that self-regulation sufficiently protects minors, without going so far as to recommend a general ban on social networks.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_447 False True De nouvelles données indépendantes étayent l’argument selon lequel la transparence publicitaire réduit les abus sans compromettre le financement des médias. || New independent data bolster the argument that advertising transparency reduces abuse without jeopardizing media funding.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_465 False True Le ministre ressasse l’argument de la souveraineté numérique, sans répondre aux objections précises concernant le coût et la faisabilité du projet. || The minister keeps harping on the digital-sovereignty argument without answering precise objections about the project’s cost and feasibility.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_468 False True Aux États-Unis, un grand jury a inculpé deux anciens dirigeants pour fraude, sans que cette décision préjuge de leur culpabilité. || In the United States, a grand jury indicted two former executives for fraud, without that decision prejudging their guilt.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_479 False True Le parti désavoue désormais la doctrine sécuritaire qu’il défendait encore l’an dernier, sans reconnaître les abus commis lors de sa mise en œuvre. || The party now repudiates the security doctrine it was still defending last year, without acknowledging the abuses committed during its implementation.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_484 False True Lors de la conférence, le dirigeant a vanté son assistant automatisé, présenté comme une révolution, sans fournir de chiffres indépendants sur ses performances réelles. || At the conference, the executive touted his automated assistant, presented as a revolution, without providing independent figures on its actual performance.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_487 False True Pendant la campagne, plusieurs chaînes ont vilipendé les magistrats chargés du dossier, les accusant sans preuve de servir des intérêts étrangers. || During the campaign, several channels vilified the judges handling the case, accusing them without evidence of serving foreign interests.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_492 False True La thèse défendue par le ministère est que cette base centralisée accélérera les enquêtes sans créer de nouvel instrument de surveillance. || The ministry’s contention is that this centralized database will accelerate investigations without creating a new surveillance instrument.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b14_notes it_fancy_vocab_536 True False Le débat reste abstrait tant que le régulateur ne publie aucun scénario chiffré montrant comment la réforme affecterait les petits éditeurs. || The debate remains abstract until the regulator publishes a quantified scenario showing how the reform would affect small publishers.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b14_notes it_fancy_vocab_555 False True Cet argument est fallacieux, car il attribue la baisse des abonnements à la régulation sans examiner l’évolution parallèle des prix. || This argument is fallacious because it attributes the decline in subscriptions to regulation without examining the parallel trend in prices.
NEG fr_fancy_vocab_b15_notes it_fancy_vocab_576 False True Le rapport rend son diagnostic abscons en multipliant les références théoriques sans montrer comment celles-ci expliquent la concentration actuelle du pouvoir médiatique. || The report makes its diagnosis abstruse by piling up theoretical references without showing how they explain the current concentration of media power.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_002 False True L'Unione europea ha regolamentato i sistemi di raccomandazione per imporre obblighi di trasparenza senza dettare alle piattaforme una linea editoriale comune. || The European Union regulated recommendation systems to impose transparency obligations without dictating a common editorial line to the platforms.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_023 False True I media indipendenti si sono adattati alle nuove regole di distribuzione senza subordinare il lavoro d'inchiesta alle priorità opache imposte dalle piattaforme. || Independent media adapted to the new distribution rules without subordinating investigative work to the opaque priorities imposed by platforms.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_026 False True Lo Stato ha investito in centri dati pubblici per ridurre la dipendenza tecnologica senza sovvenzionare una nuova generazione di fornitori dominanti. || The state invested in public data centers to reduce its technological dependence without subsidizing a new generation of dominant providers.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_031 False True La concentrazione del mercato pubblicitario digitale mina l'indipendenza editoriale, perché pochi intermediari possono penalizzare i media critici senza imporre alcun divieto formale. || Concentration in the digital advertising market undermines editorial independence because a few intermediaries can penalize critical media without imposing any formal ban.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_041 False True La redazione ha curato un dossier basato su fonti aperte, selezionando documenti verificabili e contestualizzandoli per evitare che la quantità sostituisse il giudizio editoriale. || The editorial team curated a dossier based on open sources, selecting verifiable documents and contextualizing them so that quantity would not replace editorial judgment.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_046 False True Il governo fa leva sugli appalti pubblici per imporre standard aperti, senza trasformare la politica industriale in un sussidio permanente ai fornitori dominanti. || The government leverages public procurement to impose open standards, without turning industrial policy into a permanent subsidy for dominant suppliers.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_050 False True L'autorità deve far rispettare il regolamento anche ai grandi intermediari, altrimenti gli obblighi di trasparenza resteranno meri annunci privi di conseguenze. || The authority must enforce the regulation even against major intermediaries, or the transparency obligations will remain mere announcements without consequences.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_066 False True L'indagine chiarisce i meccanismi con cui le raccomandazioni automatiche hanno favorito fonti riconducibili a reti coordinate, senza rivelare dati capaci di identificare i singoli utenti. || The investigation elucidates the mechanisms by which automated recommendations favored sources traceable to coordinated networks, without revealing data capable of identifying individual users.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b03_notes it_fancy_vocab_103 False True L'audit ha verificato la conformità dell'algoritmo ai requisiti europei, senza però esaminare gli effetti discriminatori prodotti dai dati di addestramento. || The audit verified the algorithm's conformity with European requirements without, however, examining the discriminatory effects produced by the training data.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b03_notes it_fancy_vocab_113 False True La frammentazione dello spazio informativo rende più difficile stabilire fatti condivisi e permette a narrazioni incompatibili di circolare senza un confronto diretto. || The fragmentation of the information space makes it harder to establish shared facts and allows incompatible narratives to circulate without direct confrontation.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b03_notes it_fancy_vocab_115 False True La mercificazione dei dati personali trasforma ogni gesto quotidiano in una risorsa negoziabile, spesso senza che gli utenti comprendano il processo economico sottostante. || The commodification of personal data turns every everyday action into a tradable resource, often without users understanding the underlying economic process.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b03_notes it_fancy_vocab_118 False True L'interoperabilità tra i servizi di messaggistica ridurrebbe i costi di uscita, consentendo agli utenti di cambiare piattaforma senza perdere contatti e conversazioni. || Interoperability among messaging services would reduce switching costs, allowing users to change platforms without losing contacts and conversations.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b04_notes it_fancy_vocab_121 False True La dicotomia tra sicurezza e libertà impoverisce il dibattito pubblico, perché ignora garanzie istituzionali capaci di conciliarle senza sacrifici assoluti. || The dichotomy between security and freedom impoverishes public debate because it ignores institutional safeguards capable of reconciling them without absolute sacrifices.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b04_notes it_fancy_vocab_135 False True La fluidità delle appartenenze politiche favorisce coalizioni inedite, senza cancellare le fratture sociali durature che continuano a orientare il voto. || The fluidity of political affiliations fosters novel coalitions without erasing the enduring social divisions that continue to shape voting.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b04_notes it_fancy_vocab_142 False True La reciprocità tra i due Stati resta fragile, poiché ciascuno pretende concessioni commerciali senza offrire garanzie di sicurezza equivalenti. || Reciprocity between the two states remains fragile because each demands trade concessions without offering equivalent security guarantees.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b05_notes it_fancy_vocab_190 False True La sorveglianza ubiqua trasforma ogni interazione digitale in una possibile fonte di dati, rendendo eccezionale la possibilità di agire senza essere osservati. || Ubiquitous surveillance turns every digital interaction into a potential source of data, making it exceptional to act without being observed.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b05_notes it_fancy_vocab_192 True False Un mercato non regolamentato favorisce operatori capaci di trasferire rapidamente il rischio, lasciando ai cittadini i costi delle crisi che ne derivano. || An unregulated market favors operators able to transfer risk quickly, leaving citizens with the costs of the resulting crises.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_209 False True La sorveglianza pervasiva modifica i comportamenti collettivi anche quando i cittadini ignorano quali dati vengano raccolti, da chi e per quanto tempo. || Pervasive surveillance changes collective behavior even when citizens do not know what data is collected, by whom, or for how long.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_222 False True Il discorso proteiforme del movimento assume toni ecologisti, nazionalisti o tecnocratici secondo il pubblico, senza modificare la propria struttura di potere. || The movement's protean discourse adopts environmentalist, nationalist, or technocratic tones depending on the audience, without changing its own power structure.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b07_notes it_fancy_vocab_247 False True Il disaccoppiamento economico tra Stati Uniti e Cina imporrebbe costi elevati alle imprese europee senza eliminare rapidamente le dipendenze strategiche esistenti. || Economic decoupling between the United States and China would impose high costs on European companies without quickly eliminating existing strategic dependencies.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_292 False True Il machine learning può individuare frodi nei pagamenti, ma senza controlli adeguati rischia di riprodurre discriminazioni presenti nei dati storici. || Machine learning can detect payment fraud, but without adequate controls it risks reproducing discrimination present in historical data.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_308 False True Ridurre il lead time di produzione permette alla fabbrica di reagire alla domanda senza accumulare grandi scorte di componenti costosi. || Reducing production lead time allows the factory to respond to demand without accumulating large inventories of expensive components.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_318 False True Il sistema traccia ogni lotto dalla fabbrica al rivenditore, così le autorità possono isolare rapidamente prodotti difettosi senza bloccare l'intera filiera. || The system tracks every batch from the factory to the retailer, so authorities can quickly isolate defective products without blocking the entire supply chain.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_334 True False Ogni acquisizione non contestata consolida il potere degli operatori dominanti e rende più costoso l'ingresso di concorrenti indipendenti nel mercato. || Every unchallenged acquisition entrenches the power of dominant operators and makes entry into the market more expensive for independent competitors.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_339 False True Dopo mesi di negoziati, il gruppo ha ottenuto finanziamenti pubblici per ampliare la rete senza cedere il controllo dei dati strategici. || After months of negotiations, the group secured public funding to expand the network without surrendering control of strategic data.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_347 False True La vendita di profili comportamentali resta un'attività redditizia per gli intermediari, anche quando gli utenti ignorano come vengano combinati i loro dati. || Selling behavioral profiles remains a lucrative activity for intermediaries, even when users do not know how their data are combined.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b10_notes it_fancy_vocab_364 False True Un'autorità sensibile alle esigenze di utenti vulnerabili interviene rapidamente sui reclami documentati, senza confondere la capacità di risposta con la rinuncia all'indipendenza. || A regulator responsive to the needs of vulnerable users acts quickly on substantiated complaints without confusing responsiveness with the surrender of its independence.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b11_notes it_fancy_vocab_420 False True Il ministro liquida come allarmistiche le conclusioni dell'autorità indipendente, senza rispondere ai dati sulle discriminazioni prodotte dal sistema automatizzato. || The minister dismisses the independent authority's conclusions as alarmist, without addressing the data on discrimination produced by the automated system.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_447 False True I nuovi dati rafforzano la tesi secondo cui gli obblighi di trasparenza riducono gli abusi senza compromettere la sicurezza dei sistemi. || The new data bolster the thesis that transparency requirements reduce abuses without compromising the security of the systems.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_448 True False Durante il vertice, la ministra ha sollevato la questione dei controlli sulle esportazioni, che le delegazioni avevano finora evitato per non incrinare l'alleanza regionale. || During the summit, the minister broached the issue of export controls, which the delegations had previously avoided to prevent straining the regional alliance.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_454 False True Tre membri dell'autorità hanno obiettato che il protocollo concede poteri eccessivi alla polizia, senza prevedere controlli giudiziari adeguati sull'accesso ai dati. || Three members of the authority objected that the protocol grants excessive powers to the police without providing adequate judicial oversight of access to the data.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_466 True False Il portavoce mette in dubbio la credibilità dei ricercatori, ma non contesta nessuno dei dati pubblicati nel loro rapporto indipendente. || The spokesperson impugns the researchers' credibility but disputes none of the data published in their independent report.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b12_notes it_fancy_vocab_479 False True Dopo le proteste, il partito ha rinnegato la dottrina economica che aveva difeso per vent'anni, senza spiegare le ragioni del cambiamento. || After the protests, the party repudiated the economic doctrine it had defended for twenty years without explaining the reasons for the change.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_487 False True La campagna ha demonizzato le organizzazioni umanitarie, descrivendole come complici dei trafficanti senza fornire alcuna prova di quella presunta collaborazione. || The campaign vilified humanitarian organizations, portraying them as accomplices of traffickers without providing any evidence of that alleged collaboration.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b13_notes it_fancy_vocab_512 False True La replica dell'azienda ha contestato la metodologia dell'inchiesta, senza però rispondere ai messaggi interni che documentavano il coordinamento con il governo. || The company's rebuttal challenged the investigation's methodology without, however, addressing the internal messages that documented coordination with the government.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b14_notes it_fancy_vocab_530 False True La logica sottostante resta opaca: il governo invoca la sicurezza nazionale senza spiegare quali rischi concreti la riforma dovrebbe ridurre. || The rationale remains unclear: the government invokes national security without explaining which concrete risks the reform is supposed to reduce.
NEG it_fancy_vocab_b14_notes it_fancy_vocab_536 True False Il principio resta astratto finché l'autorità non chiarisce come applicarlo ai sistemi biometrici già impiegati nelle stazioni ferroviarie. || The principle remains abstract until the authority clarifies how to apply it to biometric systems already in use in railway stations.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_017 False True A plataforma explorou a dependência econômica dos entregadores para transferir a eles os riscos do negócio sem reconhecer direitos trabalhistas básicos. || The platform exploited couriers' economic dependence to shift business risks onto them without recognizing basic labor rights.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_023 False True Veículos independentes se adaptaram às novas regras de distribuição sem subordinar o jornalismo investigativo às prioridades comerciais opacas impostas pelas plataformas. || Independent outlets adapted to the new distribution rules without subordinating investigative journalism to the opaque commercial priorities imposed by platforms.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_026 False True O Estado investiu em infraestruturas públicas de processamento de dados para reduzir a dependência tecnológica sem subsidiar outra geração de fornecedores dominantes. || The state invested in public data-processing infrastructure to reduce technological dependence without subsidizing another generation of dominant suppliers.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_031 False True A concentração do mercado de publicidade digital mina a independência editorial, pois permite que poucos intermediários penalizem veículos críticos sem impor qualquer proibição formal. || Concentration in the digital advertising market undermines editorial independence because it allows a few intermediaries to penalize critical outlets without imposing any formal ban.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_034 False True A equipe projetou um sistema de auditoria que permite examinar decisões automatizadas sem expor dados pessoais dos usuários a prestadores terceirizados. || The team designed an audit system that makes it possible to examine automated decisions without exposing users' personal data to third-party contractors.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b01_notes it_fancy_vocab_040 False True A plataforma terceirizou a moderação de conteúdo e, sem supervisão adequada, perdeu o controle sobre decisões de grande impacto nos direitos fundamentais. || The platform outsourced content moderation and, without adequate oversight, lost control over decisions with a major impact on fundamental rights.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_041 False True A equipe fez a curadoria das fontes que alimentariam o sistema, excluindo veículos sem transparência editorial ou histórico verificável de correções. || The team curated the sources that would feed the system, excluding outlets without editorial transparency or a verifiable corrections record.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_056 False True Para lidar com o impasse regulatório, o governo abriu consultas públicas sem abandonar a proposta de responsabilizar plataformas por riscos sistêmicos. || To navigate the regulatory impasse, the government opened public consultations without abandoning the proposal to hold platforms accountable for systemic risks.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_061 False True A comissão vislumbra um regime de governança no qual pesquisadores independentes possam auditar modelos comerciais sem expor dados pessoais dos usuários. || The commission envisions a governance regime in which independent researchers can audit commercial models without exposing users' personal data.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b02_notes it_fancy_vocab_062 False True O observatório usou como referência indicadores públicos para comparar a transparência das plataformas, sem adotar as métricas escolhidas pelas próprias empresas. || The observatory benchmarked platform transparency against public indicators without adopting the metrics chosen by the companies themselves.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b03_notes it_fancy_vocab_087 False True A nova norma interliga os registros nacionais de propriedade, permitindo que investigadores rastreiem empresas de fachada sem depender de pedidos bilaterais demorados. || The new rule interconnects national property registries, allowing investigators to trace shell companies without relying on slow bilateral requests.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b03_notes it_fancy_vocab_089 False True A plataforma desviou-se de seus próprios critérios de moderação quando governos pressionaram pela remoção de conteúdos legítimos sem apresentar fundamento jurídico. || The platform deviated from its own moderation criteria when governments pressed for legitimate content to be removed without providing a legal basis.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b04_notes it_fancy_vocab_126 False True A proliferação de ferramentas generativas baratas ampliou a produção de conteúdo sintético sem criar mecanismos equivalentes de verificação, responsabilização e reparação. || The proliferation of inexpensive generative tools expanded the production of synthetic content without creating equivalent mechanisms for verification, accountability, and redress.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b05_notes it_fancy_vocab_184 False True O viés algorítmico pode surgir mesmo sem intenção discriminatória, quando os dados históricos reproduzem desigualdades que o modelo aprende como padrões normais. || Algorithmic bias can arise even without discriminatory intent when historical data reproduce inequalities that the model learns as normal patterns.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_217 False True Uma empresa nativa digital pode dispensar agências físicas, mas continua sujeita às mesmas obrigações trabalhistas, tributárias e concorrenciais que qualquer empresa tradicional. || A digital-native company may do without physical branches but remains subject to the same labor, tax, and competition obligations as any traditional company.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b06_notes it_fancy_vocab_222 False True A retórica proteiforme da empresa adota um discurso ambiental, trabalhista ou nacionalista conforme o público, sem alterar seu modelo de acumulação. || The company's protean rhetoric adopts an environmental, labor, or nationalist discourse depending on the audience without changing its accumulation model.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b07_notes it_fancy_vocab_243 False True A cadeia de suprimentos de semicondutores continua vulnerável porque poucas fábricas concentram etapas críticas e governos subsidiam capacidade sem coordenar estoques estratégicos. || The semiconductor supply chain remains vulnerable because a few factories concentrate critical stages and governments subsidize capacity without coordinating strategic stockpiles.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b07_notes it_fancy_vocab_253 False True A moeda digital emitida pelo banco central pode ampliar a eficiência dos pagamentos sem reproduzir necessariamente a volatilidade típica dos criptoativos privados. || A central-bank-issued digital currency can improve payment efficiency without necessarily reproducing the volatility typical of private crypto-assets.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b08_notes it_fancy_vocab_320 False True Algumas consultorias lucraram com a crise ao vender sistemas de vigilância cuja eficácia jamais foi avaliada por autoridades independentes ou pesquisadores externos. || Some consulting firms profited from the crisis by selling surveillance systems whose effectiveness was never evaluated by independent authorities or outside researchers.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_328 False True Os novos termos violam direitos básicos de privacidade ao permitir que parceiros comerciais combinem dados médicos, financeiros e comportamentais sem consentimento específico. || The new terms violate basic privacy rights by allowing business partners to combine medical, financial, and behavioral data without specific consent.
NEG pt_fancy_vocab_b09_notes it_fancy_vocab_333 True False A coalizão teve êxito em ampliar a transparência dos anúncios políticos, mas não conseguiu limitar o uso opaco de dados por intermediários. || The coalition succeeded in increasing the transparency of political ads but failed to limit intermediaries' opaque use of data.
